      "message": "We are clearing these pages without holding _any_ lock? So we are clearing them while they may become e.g. donated to a pVM or to pKVM in the meantime (so we\u0027re gonna corrupt them while they are being used by a pVM or by pKVM)?",
      "revId": "fe77de2d1d92d36de59b90c9ee06ebcdcf406f9c",
